<section class="section-shell service-questions" aria-labelledby="service-questions-heading">
  <p class="eyebrow">Working with us</p>
  <h2 id="service-questions-heading">Practical questions</h2>
  <dl>
    <dt>Can you help structure the report before it is laid out?</dt>
    <dd>Yes. We work with the content to establish hierarchy, separate the main narrative from supporting detail and identify where charts or diagrams would explain the findings more clearly.</dd>
    <dt>Can you create an executive summary alongside the full report?</dt>
    <dd>Yes. The output can include a complete publication, an executive summary or a connected family of resources. Each is structured around the findings and decisions its audience needs first.</dd>
